      "cost": "-",
      "damage_bonus": "0",
      "description": "<p>When you perform the 【🛡️ Guard】 action, if you choose not to provide cover to another creature, your reflexes are wildly increased! Until the start of your next turn, you gain a bonus to your <strong>Defense</strong> equal to <strong>[SL]</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, if an enemy misses you with an 【⚔️ Attack】 during this time, you may perform a free 【⚔️ Attack】 against them. Treat your <strong>HR</strong> as <strong>0</strong> when calculating damage for this counterattack. Do not stack with other <strong>Counterattack </strong>effects.</p>",
